{
  "sn11.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 11.10 ",
  "sn11.10:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn11.10:0.3": "Samuddakasutta ",
  "sn11.10:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ. ",
  "sn11.10:1.2": "“Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, sambahulā isayo sīlavanto kalyāṇadhammā samuddatīre paṇṇakuṭīsu sammanti. ",
  "sn11.10:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena devāsurasaṅgāmo samupabyūḷho ahosi. ",
  "sn11.10:1.4": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, tesaṁ isīnaṁ sīlavantānaṁ kalyāṇadhammānaṁ etadahosi: ",
  "sn11.10:1.5": "‘dhammikā kho devā, adhammikā asurā. ",
  "sn11.10:1.6": "Siyāpi no asurato bhayaṁ. ",
  "sn11.10:1.7": "Yannūna mayaṁ sambaraṁ asurindaṁ upasaṅkamitvā abhayadakkhiṇaṁ yāceyyāmā’ti. ",
  "sn11.10:1.8": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, te isayo sīlavanto kalyāṇadhammā—seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya, pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—samuddatīre paṇṇakuṭīsu antarahitā sambarassa asurindassa sammukhe pāturahesuṁ. ",
  "sn11.10:1.9": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, te isayo sīlavanto kalyāṇadhammā sambaraṁ asurindaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsiṁsu: ",
  "sn11.10:2.1": "‘Isayo sambaraṁ pattā, ",
  "sn11.10:2.2": "yācanti abhayadakkhiṇaṁ; ",
  "sn11.10:2.3": "Kāmaṅkaro hi te dātuṁ, ",
  "sn11.10:2.4": "bhayassa abhayassa vā’ti. ",
  "sn11.10:3.1": "‘Isīnaṁ abhayaṁ natthi, ",
  "sn11.10:3.2": "duṭṭhānaṁ sakkasevinaṁ; ",
  "sn11.10:3.3": "Abhayaṁ yācamānānaṁ, ",
  "sn11.10:3.4": "bhayameva